      "created_at": "2019-10-26T09:13:26Z",
      "updated_at": "2019-10-26T09:13:26Z",
      "body": "As an advantage, I see that we can define instances close to data types and thus less chances that they will go out of sync.\r\n\r\nMy initial idea was to use default constructors and if new field appears we just ignore it instead of copying it without anonymization. But this require more effort.",
